=== Men ===
[[File:Zarra, Telmo 1950 Estadio 0376.jpg|thumb|upright|[[Telmo Zarra]] won the inaugural Pichichi Trophy in 1953 and amassed a total of six. He remains the Spanish player who has won the award the most times.]]
[[File:Quini 1983.jpg|thumb|upright|[[Quini]] won the Pichichi Trophy with two different clubs.]]
[[File:Leo Messi (cropped).jpg|thumb|upright|[[Lionel Messi]] has won the<br>Pichichi Trophy a record eight times<ref>{{Cite web|title=Leo Messi wins his seventh Pichichi, a LaLiga record|url=https://www.fcbarcelona.com/en/football/first-team/news/1732775/leo-messi-wins-his-seventh-pichichi-a-laliga-record|access-date=19 July 2020|website=www.fcbarcelona.com|language=en|archive-date=21 May 2023|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230521023718/https://www.fcbarcelona.com/en/football/first-team/news/1732775/leo-messi-wins-his-seventh-pichichi-a-laliga-record|url-status=live}}</ref>]]
